# Allowlist approach: ignore everything by default, then explicitly
# un-ignore only the active Jarvis system's own files. Far more robust
# than trying to enumerate this folder's many old backup folders
# individually (tried that first -- missed several; this folder has
# accumulated ~15+ old version snapshots from before git existed here).
# Nothing on disk is touched or deleted by any of this -- it only
# controls what git tracks going forward.
*

!.gitignore
!Jarvis_FINAL_WORKING.py
!Jarvis_Desktop_HUD.py
!jarvis_hud.html
!jarvis_memory.json
!START_JARVIS_FINAL_WORKING.bat
!START_JARVIS_DESKTOP_HUD.bat
!eva_prompter.py
!host_agent_processor.py
!jarvis_ask_user_mcp.py
!jarvis_launcher.py
!_active_dev_session.json
!cloudflare_worker_failover.js
!jarvis_business.py
!jarvis_blog.py
!jarvis_analytics.py
!jarvis_business_context.py
!jarvis_browser.py
!jarvis_agent.py

# Jarvis v2 (Claude Code brain, window, runs, self-improvement) and its companions.
# Its data/ folder (memory, run history, tokens, browser profile) and the generated
# home/ folder are runtime state, never source -- re-ignored below.
!jarvis_v2/
!jarvis_v2/**
jarvis_v2/data/
jarvis_v2/home/
!jarvis_money.py
!START_JARVIS_V2.bat
!LATER_JOBS.md
!docs/
!docs/JARVIS_V2_PLAN.md
**/__pycache__/

# jarvis_business.db (the real business brain -- opportunities, experiments,
# money) and generated_articles/ (its content output) are deliberately left
# ignored by the blanket "*" above -- this is Danny's live, growing business
# data, not source code, so it stays untracked the same way Jarvis Phone's
# data/ folder does elsewhere in this project.

# LibreHardwareMonitor: vendored third-party tool, not source code --
# only track our own config for it, not its ~19MB of binaries/DLLs.
!LibreHardwareMonitor/
LibreHardwareMonitor/*
!LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor.config

# Trading research lab: the Python package and the design doc are source.
# trading_lab/ (the Freqtrade venv, downloaded candle data, the registry
# database, reports, paper-trading state) is data/tooling and stays ignored.
!jarvis_trading/
!jarvis_trading/**
jarvis_trading/**/__pycache__/
jarvis_trading/**/*.pyc
!trading_lab/
trading_lab/*
!trading_lab/DESIGN.md

# Store control (Shopify drafts + CJ research). store_data/ (audit log) stays ignored.
!jarvis_store/
!jarvis_store/**
jarvis_store/**/__pycache__/
!jarvis_christmas_video.py
!jarvis_video.py

# Marketing department (docs/MARKETING_DEPT_PLAN.md). Its data/ folder (the mock and live
# databases, rendered assets, the laptop-login hash and businesses.json) is runtime state.
!jarvis_marketing/
!jarvis_marketing/**
jarvis_marketing/data/
jarvis_marketing/**/__pycache__/
!docs/MARKETING_DEPT_PLAN.md
